  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects primary focus is on enhancing livelihoods, a crucial element in promoting economic sustainability for vulnerable populations in Syria. It seeks to empower individuals and households, with a special emphasis on swift livelihood support and the development of sustainable livelihoods and local economic recovery. Gender disparities are addressed, particularly in empowering women economically. Furthermore, disability inclusion and accessibility are priorities. Overall, the project aims</narrative>
